{"sections":[{"slug":"链复形范畴的同伦范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"链复形范畴的同伦范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">链复形范畴的同伦范畴</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“链复形范畴的同伦范畴”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">本页介绍</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/链复形无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">链复形无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/加性范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">加性范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的链复形范畴</span> $\\mathsf {Ch}(\\mathcal A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/链复形范畴的同伦范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">链复形范畴的同伦范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf K(\\mathcal A)$ (<span lang=\"zh\">态射是链映射的同伦类</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/三角范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">三角范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\mathsf K(\\mathcal A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的逐项分裂序列</span> (termwise splitting sequence) $0\\to A \\to B\\to C \\to 0$ <span lang=\"zh\">为存在收缩</span> $r\\colon B\\to A$ <span lang=\"zh\">与截面</span> $s\\colon C\\to B$ <span lang=\"zh\">的短正合列</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $\\alpha\\colon A\\to B$, <strong><span lang=\"zh\">映射锥</span></strong> $C=B\\oplus A[1]$, $C^n=B^n\\oplus A^{n+1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成逐项分裂序列</span>\n$$\r\n0\\to B\\to C \\to A[1]\\to 0,$$<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的微分</span>\n$$\r\nd=\\begin{pmatrix}\r\nd_B &amp; \\alpha \\\\\r\n&amp; -d_A\r\n\\end{pmatrix}.\r\n$$</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“<span lang=\"zh\">几乎所有</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">特殊三角都是映射锥</span>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> E(A)</h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">令</span> $E(\\mathcal A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathsf K(\\mathcal A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中正合列的范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">它是</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">严格满子范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">对同构封闭</span>);</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">饱和子范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">对取直和项封闭</span>);</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">三角子范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">特殊三角中两者属于这个子范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则第三者属于这个子范畴</span>).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\mathsf K(\\mathcal A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的子范畴</span>\n$$\r\nE(\\mathcal A)^\\perp = \\{X\\in\\mathsf K(\\mathcal A):\\operatorname{Hom}(E,X)=0\\,\\forall E\\in E(\\mathcal A)\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">若一个对象到</span> $E(\\mathcal A)^{\\perp}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的对象有</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">拟同构</span></strong>, <span lang=\"zh\">则这个拟同构的映射锥为</span> $E(\\mathcal A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">内射对象组成的下有界链复形属于</span> $E(\\mathcal A)^\\perp$. (<span lang=\"zh\">这说明内射下有界复形在定义</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">时是一种良好的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">替代</span>”.)</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> Verdier <span lang=\"zh\">商</span>:\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n\t{ccccc}\r\n\tE(\\mathcal A) &amp;\\to&amp; \\mathsf K(\\mathcal A) &amp;\\to&amp; \\mathsf D(\\mathcal A)\\\\\r\n\t&amp;&amp; \\uparrow &amp; \\nearrow \\text{equivalence}\\hspace{-5em}&amp;\\\\\r\n\t&amp;&amp; E(\\mathcal A)^\\perp &amp;&amp;\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n"},{"Local":{"url":"/凝聚层的导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚层的导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/半正交分解","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">半正交分解</span>"}},{"Plain":" (?)</p>\n"}]}}}]}